  "mechanisticConclusion": "The tested TSDF weighting intervention has limited mechanical opportunity on these exposed 8-view scenes. Median naive-vs-relative fusion leverage is exactly zero in all five rooms; conflict+mixed-confidence voxels are uncommon (0.498% to 5.205% of surface-active voxels); and only 2.078% to 10.968% of surface-active voxels move by at least a quarter voxel. This explains why a globally predictive uncertainty model can fail to produce robust geometry gains under scalar TSDF reweighting.",
